## 2026-02-22 Update - ICM-20948 IMU Pipeline

### New gateway artifacts

- Adapter contract added: `src/adapters/imu.ts`
  - `ImuConfig`, `ImuRawReading`, `ImuOrientation`, `ImuDataPacket`, `ImuAdapter`
- Adapter export added: `src/adapters/index.ts`
- Signal K publisher added: `src/publishers/signalkPublisher.ts`
  - `SignalKHttpPublisher` with `connect()` and delta publish by context
- Publisher exports added:
  - `src/publishers/index.ts`
  - `src/index.ts`

### Raspberry Pi runtime scripts

Folder: `rpi/omi-imu/`

- `01_test_sensor.py`: 9-axis read test at configurable Hz.
- `02_publish_signalk.py`: IMU read + complementary fusion + publish.
- `setup.sh`: platform/I2C checks, dependency install, one-shot probe.

### Signal K behavior observed in validated environment

Validation date: 2026-02-22.

- `GET /signalk/v1/api/` reachable (`HTTP 200`).
- `POST /signalk/v1/api/` returned `404` ("Cannot POST ...").
- `PUT /signalk/v1/api/vessels/self/...` returned `405` ("PUT not supported ...").
- WebSocket publish to `/signalk/v1/stream?subscribe=none` succeeded.

For this reason, `02_publish_signalk.py` uses publish fallbacks in order:

1. Delta HTTP POST
2. REST PUT
3. WebSocket send (active fallback in current instance)

### Verified read endpoints

- `/signalk/v1/api/vessels/self/navigation/headingMagnetic`
- `/signalk/v1/api/vessels/self/navigation/attitude`
- `/signalk/v1/api/vessels/self/sensors/imu`

